
@{
    ViewBag.Title = "PrivacyPolicy";
    Layout = "~/Views/Shared/_Layout.cshtml";
}


<div class="rbt-overlay-page-wrapper privacy-page">

    <div class="breadcrumb-image-container breadcrumb-style-max-width">
        <div class="breadcrumb-image-wrapper">
            <div class="breadcrumb-dark"></div>
        </div>
        <div class="breadcrumb-content-top text-center">
            <h1 class="title">Privacy Policy</h1>
            <p class="mb--20">Histudy Course Privacy Policy Here.</p>
            <ul class="page-list">
                <li class="rbt-breadcrumb-item"><a href="@Url.Action("Index","Index")">Home</a></li>
                <li>
                    <div class="icon-right"><i class="feather-chevron-right"></i></div>
                </li>
                <li class="rbt-breadcrumb-item active">Privacy Policy</li>
            </ul>
        </div>
    </div>


    <div class="rbt-putchase-guide-area breadcrumb-style-max-width rbt-section-gapBottom">
        <div class="rbt-article-content-wrapper">
            <div class="post-thumbnail mb--30 position-relative wp-block-image alignwide">
                <center>
                    <img class="w-50" src="~/assets/images/blog/privacy-policy.svg" alt="CoursesHub privacy policy - your data, protected">
                </center>
            </div>
            <div class="content">
                <p>
                    At <b>CoursesHub</b>, we are committed to protecting your privacy. This Privacy Policy outlines how we collect, use, store, and disclose your personal information when you use our website and services. By accessing or using our platform, you agree to the collection and use of information in accordance with this policy.
                </p>
                <p>
                    Sed ut perspiciatis unde omnis iste natus error sit voluptatem accusantium doloremque
                    laudantium, totam rem aperiam, eaque ipsa quae ab illo inventore veritatis et quasi
                </p>

                <h4>1. Information We Collect</h4>
                <p>We collect two types of information from users of CoursesHub:</p>
                <p><h5>•	Personal Information: </h5>Information that identifies you personally, such as:</p>
                <p>o	Name</p>
                <p>o	Email address</p>
                <p>o	Phone number</p>
                <p>o	Date of birth</p>
                <p>o	Academic history (e.g., transcripts)</p>
                <p>o	Identification documents (e.g., passport, driver’s license)</p>
                <p>o	Payment information for transactions</p>
                <p>o	Any other information you provide when registering or interacting with our platform</p>

                <p><h5>•	Non-Personal Information: </h5>Information that does not identify you personally but helps us improve our services, such as:</p>
                <p>o	IP address</p>
                <p>o	Browser type</p>
                <p>o	Device information</p>
                <p>o	Browsing behavior on our website (pages viewed, time spent on the site)</p>
                <p>o	Cookies and similar tracking technologies (see section below on Cookies)</p>

                <h4>2. How We Use Your Information</h4>
                <p>We use the information we collect for the following purposes:</p>
                <p><h5>•	To Provide Services:</h5>To process your Training Provider applications, manage your account, and provide course information.</p>
                <p><h5>•	To Communicate with You: </h5>To respond to your inquiries, process transactions, and send you updates, offers, or newsletters (if you’ve opted in).</p>
                <p><h5>•	To Improve Our Platform: </h5>To enhance the user experience, analyze trends, and gather feedback on how to improve our website and services.</p>
                <p><h5>•	To Comply with Legal Obligations: </h5>To fulfill our legal obligations, such as responding to law enforcement requests or regulatory requirements.</p>


                <h4>3. How We Share Your Information</h4>
                <p>We do not sell or rent your personal information to third parties. However, we may share your information with trusted third-party service providers in the following cases:</p>
                <p><h5>•	Training Provider Partners: </h5>If you apply for a course through CoursesHub, we may share the relevant information with the universities or institutions you’re applying to for the purpose of processing your application.</p>
                <p><h5>•	Service Providers: </h5>We may share your data with trusted third-party vendors who provide services to us, such as payment processors, website hosting, and email marketing services. These providers are contractually bound to protect your personal information and use it only for the purposes of performing services on our behalf.</p>
                <p><h5>•	Legal Compliance: </h5>We may disclose your information if required by law or to protect the rights, property, or safety of CoursesHub, our users, or others.</p>



                <h4>4. Cookies and Tracking Technologies</h4>
                <ol>
                    <li>
                        CoursesHub uses cookies and similar technologies to improve your experience on our website. Cookies are small text files that are stored on your device when you visit our website. These cookies help us remember your preferences and personalize your experience.
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        You can control how cookies are used on your device through your browser settings. However, please note that disabling cookies may affect the functionality of our website.
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        We may use third-party analytics tools (e.g., Google Analytics) to track user behavior and gather insights to improve our platform.
                    </li>
                </ol>

                <h4>5. Data Security</h4>
                <ol>
                    <li>
                        We implement reasonable security measures to protect your personal information from unauthorized access, disclosure, alteration, or destruction. However, no method of transmission over the internet or method of electronic storage is 100% secure, and we cannot guarantee absolute security.
                    </li>
                </ol>

                <h4>6. Your Rights and Choices</h4>
                <p>You have the following rights regarding your personal information:</p>
                <p><h5>•	Access: </h5>You have the right to request access to the personal information we hold about you.</p>
                <p><h5>•	Correction:</h5>If any of your information is incorrect or incomplete, you have the right to request that it be corrected.</p>
                <p><h5>•	Deletion: </h5>You can request that we delete your personal information, subject to certain legal exceptions.</p>
                <p><h5>•	Opt-Out: </h5>You can opt out of receiving marketing communications by clicking the “unsubscribe” link in our emails or contacting us directly at [email@courseshub.com].</p>
                <p>If you wish to exercise any of these rights or have any concerns about how we handle your personal information, please contact us at [privacy@courseshub.com].</p>

                <h4>7. Data Retention</h4>
                <ol>
                    <li>
                        We retain your personal information only for as long as necessary to fulfill the purposes outlined in this Privacy Policy or as required by law. If you close your account or ask us to delete your data, we will retain your information only for the period necessary to comply with legal or regulatory requirements.
                    </li>
                </ol>

                <h4>8. International Data Transfers</h4>
                <ol>
                    <li>
                        As we may engage third-party service providers located outside of Australia, your personal information may be transferred and processed internationally. By using CoursesHub, you consent to the transfer of your personal data to countries outside of Australia, where data protection laws may differ.
                    </li>
                </ol>

                <h4>9. Links to Other Websites</h4>
                <ol>
                    <li>
                        CoursesHub may contain links to other websites that are not operated by us. We are not responsible for the privacy practices or the content of these external websites. We encourage you to review their privacy policies before providing them with any personal information.
                    </li>
                </ol>

                <h4>10. Changes to this Privacy Policy</h4>
                <ol>
                    <li>
                        We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time to reflect changes in our practices or for other operational, legal, or regulatory reasons. When we update the policy, we will post the updated version on this page and update the "Last Updated" date at the top of the page.
                    </li>
                </ol>

                <h4>11. Contact Us</h4>
                <ol>
                    <li>
                        If you have any questions about this Privacy Policy or wish to exercise any of your rights, please contact us:
                    </li>
                </ol>
                <h4>CoursesHub</h4><br />
                <b>Email : </b>privacy@courseshub.com <br />
                <b>
                    Phone : <b>
                        <br />
                        <b>Address : </b><br />

            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

</div>

